I had a blast making my kids color these cards for their grandparents. I hope you do too!!&nbsp;

<strong>For best results:</strong> use crayons or a non-liquid pigment like colored pencils if you're printing with an ink jet printer. If you're printing with a laser printer, feel free to bust out those watercolors or fabulous markers you've got lying around.&nbsp;

